WEBVTT

00:00.262 --> 00:05.692
This is Anatono. It helps elders and their families never miss a dose.

00:06.848 --> 00:12.518
Snap a medicine or a prescription, and Gemma 4 reads it, through the Gemini API.

00:13.429 --> 00:21.419
Then plain code, not the model, checks every medicine: the dates, missing details, the same ingredient twice.

00:22.063 --> 00:24.693
Type how you take it, even in Roman Urdu.

00:25.483 --> 00:29.473
Gemma 4 understands it, and code sets the exact times.

00:30.405 --> 00:34.475
Confirm, and calendar alarms ring even when the app is closed.

00:36.335 --> 00:39.685
An expired pack? Code says: don't take it.

00:43.020 --> 00:53.170
Gemma 4 does all the reading and understanding. Gemini Flash-Lite only turns speech into text. It's also an agent skill, and open source under MIT.

00:54.424 --> 00:57.014
It's live at anatono dot site.

01:00.029 --> 01:03.779
Gemma 4 reads. Code checks. You confirm.
